<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Father is the mighty God,</l><l>His purpose is but one—</l><l>To find a Bride for Christ the Lord</l><l>And give her to His Son.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Son is Jesus Christ the Lord,</l><l>His heart desire’s but one—</l><l>To have a loving counterpart,</l><l>A Bride He’s wooed and won.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Spirit is but Christ Himself,</l><l>He is the Lord applied</l><l>To generate the men of earth,</l><l>Transform them as His Bride.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The living Word is Jesus too,</l><l>God-breathed as life to us,</l><l>That we be wholly sanctified,</l><l>A Bride all-glorious.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
